{"availability":"available","full":"tinyfish-io/agentql","name":"agentql","description":"AgentQL is a suite of tools for connecting your AI to the web. Featuring a query language and Playwright integrations for interacting with elements and extracting data quickly, precisely, and at scale. Includes REST API, Python and JavaScript SDKs, browser debugger.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1477,"forks":177,"created":"2024-02-20T19:56:33Z","updated":"2026-10-02T09:00:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://agentql.com","topics":["agent","ai","aiagent","automation","javascript","playwright","python","rpa","scraping","web","web-scraping","web-scraping-colabs","web-scraping-javascript","web-scraping-python","web-scrapping","webagent"],"demo":"https://playground.agentql.com/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:33.498Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:33.498Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:33.498Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:37:36.687Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:27.128Z","stars":1476,"forks":177},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:19.012Z","stars":1476,"forks":177},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:33.498Z","stars":1477,"forks":177}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AgentQL is a suite of tools for extracting data and automating workflows on live web sites featuring an AI-powered query language, Python and JavaScript SDKs, a browser-based debugger, and a REST API endpoint. It uses natural language queries to pinpoint data and elements on any web page, including authenticated and dynamically generated content. Users can define structured data output and apply transforms within queries. AgentQL's natural language selectors find elements intuitively based on the content of the web page and work across similar web sites, self-healing as UI changes over time.","Get started in 5 minutes with our quick start!"],"features":["Playwright AgentQL's Python SDK and JavaScript SDK seamlessly integrates with Playwright for advanced automation and testing.","Cross-site compatibility lets you use the same query across different sites with similar content.","Structured output defined by the shape of your query.","Natural language selectors find elements and data anywhere on a site using intuitive queries.","Transforms and extracts data in your queries."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tinyfish-io/agentql/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"49f2a7859473deb87e18283c58be43fed3b2d9287b7f594013b5b9a0cf1f4be7","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T05:59:21.957Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:13:16.163Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T09:00:41Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:57.399Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:57.399Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/7e8dea0e04ad7a4b87b8f70d.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-04T18:17:07.454Z","url":"https://playground.agentql.com/"}],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T06:13:11.488Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"AgentQL is a suite of tools for extracting data and automating workflows on live web sites featuring an AI-powered query language, Python and JavaScript SDKs, a browser-based debugger, and a REST API endpoint. It uses natural language queries to pinpoint data and elements on any web page, including authenticated and dynamically generated content. Users can define structured data output and apply transforms within queries. AgentQL's natural language selectors find elements intuitively based on the content of the web page and work across similar web sites, self-healing as UI changes over time.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tinyfish-io/agentql/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"49f2a7859473deb87e18283c58be43fed3b2d9287b7f594013b5b9a0cf1f4be7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tinyfish-io/agentql/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T06:13:16.163Z"},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://playground.agent